png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_GeneralCityStreets_PotteryPayment</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_GeneralCityStreets_PotteryPayment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_GeneralCityStreets_PotteryPayment\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">4d2b33d5-8bb5-4929-9c34-e12ee61340ae</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4d2b33d5-8bb5-4929-9c34-e12ee61340ae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4d2b33d5-8bb5-4929-9c34-e12ee61340ae\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a mailbox in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;92&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;5</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Thank you for repairing my wife's vase - she's been sad ever since the <a href=\"/wiki/Upper_City\" title=\"Upper City\">Upper City</a> was sealed and she can't see her siblings, and this will go a long way to cheer her up, as the vase was a gift from them. I've added a gratuity to your fee to cover your rush and in gratitude for the care you took.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211514\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1351/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23727/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5635/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936107/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.695      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.695      1 -total\n 50.78%   21.173      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.33%   18.900     15 Template:Trim\n 24.31%   10.137      2 Template:Uid\n 16.19%    6.749      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.53%    5.640      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.59%    4.416      1 Template:Notes\n 10.27%    4.281      6 Template:Ifempty\n  9.75%    4.066      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:32493-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714211514 and revision id 394202. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}